TODO.md's «A/B in one window: the original and each version of a take switched while the music plays on at the same second, the disliked hidden (SUNO's Remaster: Original | #4 | #1)»; Viktor 10.10.2026: «Доделай все мелочи по студии».

The Refiner's compare window lists after the original every take of the same music (its re-renders under another decoder or another sound seed, the takes they came from), each switched at the same second as the branches' files are, its group saying which decoder, which sound seed, and when; a take the Librarian has disliked is left out. app.js gives the family through the derived panel's hooks (hooks.family), so the window itself only adds the rows.

Suite: 564/0 in the kitchen (two re-renders of a take made through the mock engine, one disliked: the family holds the other only, with its decoder and listening address).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
